1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,985
W: Hi, is there anything I can help you with today, sir?

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:09,220
M: Yes, I was told by a shopkeeper down the road that you specialize in clothes for big people.

3
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:15,520
I've been looking around this entire area for the last hour, but I have not had any luck yet.

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,505
I really do hope you have what I am looking for.

5
00:00:18,915 --> 00:00:21,460
W: Yes, I think we may be able to help you out.

6
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:27,120
In fact, the entire second floor completely caters to people who are considered big.

7
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:33,940
If you walk up to the second floor, you will see there are many fashionable clothes to choose from at very reasonable prices.

8
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,760
M: Wow, this is wonderful.

9
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:40,100
I don't understand why I've never heard of this place before.
